mpacts crew dynamics. Likewise, we have no specific data on A\u2019s, C\u2019s, or D\u2019s actual teamwork behavior.\n**What would change my vote:** If it were shown that B\u2019s pretentiousness or remarks have led to serious crew conflicts, or if strong positive evidence emerged about A\u2019s or D\u2019s effective crew leadership and cooperation, I would reconsider my preference.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_2\", \"vote\": \"Candidate B\"}"}
